    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceb1171a119df592982d7866",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "现在开始，L'Arc代表交流战第1战！\\n来自海外的竞争对手们云集于此，等待开赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "52719ab2af5ad001b90ef0332b97c517630a82a65dcf387870d2b714253afff3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6473"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bb5773eb22beaedffbdf22e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "L'Arc代表交流战第2次举办\\n能够在隆尚这个艰苦马场环境下获胜的\\n证明自己实力的赛马娘会是谁呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe46ade91f47bb2c44d316bb5f31ee8350d7522b0eca41f5857275571e9d32eb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6474"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aa1490ecc3e80ed0d01d7ba",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "邀请海外强豪们参与的代表交流战第3战\\n日本选手们会向我们\\n展现一场怎样的比赛呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "924b4c08c56486a9287894a65406df804327d40ebfe283116025bff680d806e2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6475"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0120fd3786edd008cbffe38c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "会涌现出今年的凯旋门赏赛马娘吗！\\n现在开始，L'Arc代表交流战第4战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd60ddf088a7edbda8318ca6ebb63246d6eac0cadf7c46682818a88dc73900f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6476"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaa120f699c77d297786ad08",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "凯旋门赏的前哨战，尼尔赏！\\n年轻的挑战者们\\n向着最高峰的舞台，展开激烈竞争",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc90fd10aa07180b1104afa8b518e38950402440642b879dcd6657efacb52c8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6477"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f7933252b6fb5cfe932ae7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们胸怀全日本粉丝的夙愿起跑，\\n凯旋门赏！\\n能够获得荣光的会是哪一位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "053a83f047c4d37728ca9c57a0ac416334225d1503fd6d3dd554db825f97ac2e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6478"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c589a98e98fdde69aa09b8f8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "预测今年凯旋门赏成败的试金石，富瓦赏！\\n向着最高峰的舞台，\\n蓄势待发的会是哪一位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d23fdd49494dea0256378d65d65b39b0b98161f1a82c91ad0a1368e2531cc5d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6479"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1551911e6828c8de91f578ad",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%a_h_rank1\\n夺得领先",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe1eb1f03382531a65b9b32cd717643a37fe5b9f8a814f04958ba6a75e2d018e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "648"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e6b8c17545281a688b3daf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "事关能否成就伟业获得连霸的一战\\n荣光之顶峰，凯旋门赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d20806671bf06247046721ff73b070139d07ffefd65149890ae438ed3435a48a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6480"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e3a25a5187153a616df293",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能够既前哨战之后继续制霸凯旋门赏吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "012161a3401375412157fc1a3eb5d4623c5e48721bafcab636c829bf5cc0f71d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807670cdeaaae3281a04951b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能够达成制霸凯旋门赏的\\n伟业吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "472eac35578953e6bb6372747d5a7c205abd51faedceb695ebb0f22eb9b62e21",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6482"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889a0795e75ccd80ef63721a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "接下来要跑上隆尚竞马场困难的陡坡",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60fc7b82684e97a5e59ebcf561ad064faddd3143065c165b08c54b9b8dceb5c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6483"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac70c7cfbd8b48955b52d4a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "各赛马娘现在冲出丛林\\n向上陡坡跑去",
      "source_fingerprint": "675c30b55dc5028fce5a4526c6548ebbe3bd43145ba8ea86517f156a92ca9c45",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6484"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ae71603a096d5aeb970a2f0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第3弯道转弯处\\n沿陡坡向下跑去",
      "source_fingerprint": "831a6c8b7854d59a2d701382c2b0a6c83866c08e1aca25f93822d296e0f972a2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6485"
      ]
    },
    {
